      "evidence_or_problem": "[00:53:55\u201300:54:26] in the limit when n is much larger than d. So this means that we are trying to apply Bayesian inference in a situation where we know that maximum likelihood estimation is theoretically justified and is the best possible estimation method. And it can be proven that under those constraints, our two posterior distribution converges to the delta function around maximum likelihood estimate."
