      "claim": "Bayesian methods regularize MLE for situations where MLE is not optimal.",
      "supported": true,
      "evidence_or_problem": "[00:55:14\u201300:55:50] So first of all, it allows us to regularize the maximum likelihood estimates. In other words, it modifies maximum likelihood estimates for the situations when maximum likelihood estimation is not optimal."
