      "claim": "Bayesian methods can build complex models from simple ones, combining information from different sources.",
      "supported": true,
      "evidence_or_problem": "[00:55:52\u201300:57:05] So second is can build complex models from simple ones, just like we did in this example with the elephant. So we can combine information from different sources within one framework."
